$\mathsf{B a F}_{2}\mathsf{T e F}_{2}(\mathsf{O H})_{2}$ : A UV Nonlinear Optical Fluorotellurite Material Designed by Band-gap Engineering
†Tianjin Key Laboratory of Functional Crystal Materials, Institute of Functional Crystal, Tianjin University of Technology, Tianjin 300384, China. ‡Department of Chemistry, University of Houston, 112 Fleming Building, Houston, Texas 77204-5003, United States
